  "source_limits": [
    "This profile covers the Burns Paiute Tribal government and attributes the account of Wadatika ancestors to the Tribe. It does not create a profile for the entire Northern Paiute people.",
    "Modern population, differing recognition chronology and land acreage are outside scope. The 1972 law establishes the reservation in trust. The 2017 resolution documents action on that date without claiming current language conditions or implementation outcomes."
